ine learning is never right 100% of  the time so you really want to be able  to build that the user experience in a  way that when it is right you're  providing value and when it's not right  you're not getting in the way of the end  user  down okay so that was like a journey  through a bunch of stuff that we've done  over like the last five years I think  hopefully you agree with me that there  is a lot more to building data product  than just building models certainly this  is kind of like a note to my old self  from graduating uni days that there is a  lot more involved in this and there's a  lot more people involved in making it  actually go I think hopefully some of  those lessons are useful things and you  can get some takeaways from those I'm  happy to talk about any of this and more  in the office hours this is my thank you  slide you'll notice in the small text on  the side that says we're hiring you can  ask me about that too  Cheers  [Applause]

